{title: Toh Phir Aao}
{artist: Mustafa Zahid Aawarapan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]toh phir [G]aao mujhko sa [F]taao,        [Am]toh phir [G]aao mujhko ru [F]laao
[Am]Aaaa aa aa,        [Am]dil badal ba [G]ne
[F]aankhein behne la [Am]ge,        [Am]aahein aise u [G]thein
[F]jaise aandhi cha [G]lein,        [Am]toh phir [G]aao mujhko sa [F]taao
[Am]toh phir [G]aao mujhko ru [F]laao,        aa bhi [Am]jaao aa bhi
[G]jaao aa bhi [F]jaao,        aa bhi [Am]jaao aa bhi
[G]jaao aa bhi [F]jaao ho ho ho,        [Am]gum le ja te [G]re,
[F]jo bhi tune di [Am]ye,        [Am]ya phir mujhko ba [G]ta,
[F]inko kaise sa [G]hein,        [Am]toh phir [G]aao mujhko sa [F]taao
[Am]toh phir [G]aao mujhko ru [F]laao,        aa bhi [Am]jaao
aa bhi [G]jaao aa bhi [F]jaao,        aa bhi [Am]jaao aa bhi
[G]jaao aa bhi [F]jaao ho ho ho
